# ============================================
# Flutter / Dart Project .gitignore (Fixed)
# ============================================

# ===== 🚨 核心修复：强制忽略 IDE 缓存与大文件 =====
# 即使文件藏在深层目录，也会被彻底忽略
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.log

# ===== Flutter / Dart 构建产物 =====
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.packages
.pub-cache/
.pub/
build/
**/build/

# ===== Visual Studio (Windows) =====
# 已通过上方的 **/.vs/ 统一处理，这里补充其他文件
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

